# 6. Methodology

The project follows an exploratory data analysis methodology consisting of data ingestion, data cleaning, feature engineering, KPI development, visualization and interpretation.

## 6.1 Data Ingestion

The dataset was imported into Microsoft Power BI using Power Query.

The timestamp field was converted into an appropriate date-time data type. The records were organized chronologically to support time-based analysis.

## 6.2 Data Cleaning

The data preparation process included:

- Inspection of missing timestamps.
- Verification of data types.
- Examination of duplicate records.
- Inspection of negative and unusually high ticket counts.
- Chronological sorting.
- Validation of sales and redemption fields.

Unusual observations should be investigated rather than automatically deleted, as unusually high demand may represent genuine peak travel activity.

The final report should document the actual number of missing records, duplicates and any exclusions after validation.

