Using Microsoft Power BI, Power Query and DAX, an interactive analytical dashboard was developed to examine hourly ticket demand, ticket redemptions, seasonal differences and peak-demand periods.

The preliminary analysis identifies 12:00–13:00 as the highest-demand hourly interval in the displayed results and indicates stronger summer demand in the seasonal comparison.

The developed dashboard provides an accessible way to examine historical demand patterns and can support discussions around scheduling, staffing, seasonal planning and terminal management.

